  /*
   * Optimized forward-substitution kernel.
   *
   * Changes relative to the baseline:
   *  - Use an explicit accumulator `sum` instead of repeatedly updating x[i].
   *    This reduces memory traffic to x[i] and makes the dataflow clearer.
   *  - Hoist a row pointer `Lrow` so the compiler can generate more efficient
