 *    dot-product pattern that is more amenable to vectorization.
 *  - Use a row pointer (Li) for the current row of L to avoid repeated
 *    address calculations inside the j-loop.
 *  - Add an OpenMP SIMD hint on the inner loop to encourage the
 *    compiler to generate vector instructions where possible.
 *
 *  The mathematical result is the same as the original code; differences
 *  are limited to the usual floating-point rounding variations due to
 *  re-association of operations.
